{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f07921eb2740e8730ccb48598bbf0dd508664e87cf291cd71e4c5d1421116d9b",
      "source_sha256": "cc3f2eed078b43541bb709425d2c7aa1743c1d1f7b35434c7d908310536614dc",
      "translation": "这是……？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7aad117f8cab0c204f30fe742d89eb87a371e88713cb64e8ec796759ff663e82",
      "source_sha256": "95b533878e9bbb7bfad499a561b4f21382ccbe9a85be3850f23fd13895bf33d5",
      "translation": "啊，好像就是在海底洞窟见过的古代文字。拜托你了，塞蕾丝汀。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:122119a049b32dc860d1c9bf30c73701442e75c547dd9d5f45822c2daa744a1e",
      "source_sha256": "59f8af9f919215b6e9eba049ba0eb5233fda272ea66e980e3c8860c644c1c75c",
      "translation": "知道了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a6572ea7e5c49b832b1e0e2132777747c43080241c3fe3d3a6304d5597871fc5",
      "source_sha256": "6e19f3fe2a28ad0b0e4cbfb9e8101257355455bf1a4c86bdfe442d40ae0222fc",
      "translation": "这里是第一道关卡。想要通过此处，就挑战“明智之试炼”吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:45154a24bd5524e25fc06c7dca888ad96705073b538781d7b39b21943fc8f794",
      "source_sha256": "dfb241c6115c4ad0fdf929fe9b67f694984c4e527b867641c737961d9a7b5cc3",
      "translation": "明智之试炼的目标，是抵达“智慧”“聪敏”“洞察”这3个区域中的指定岛屿。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d919e9e098107a7f029c158fce32a1654dbe39856c60f489760028c8a26e21c5",
      "source_sha256": "18c00782541bc4865acb0a2b99706b209826809f48b501c73df13143e2848c68",
      "translation": "各区域的岛上，有对应四种属性的4种开关。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:732465dfac497fe39e584231e8b4bb780ca13966fda58aeed13ff55e8982a9c5",
      "source_sha256": "396363122b5581e14edad382ba46bd64f7a8b739be7e7487e6a52a4d53b62373",
      "translation": "在开关附近，产生2个与开关“颜色”对应属性的KAN，容器便会产生反应，打开连接岛屿的道路。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ca486b76dd15f947afbe730a8201f1d0e81cff6593dcd14a3f703152c058456c",
      "source_sha256": "5b548780053f7f1907109291d4b8237015a48fad7f899d7b978fadd1804ca802",
      "translation": "但是，触发开关的顺序不对，就不会打开正确的道路。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7e60aebb2c28dc9f013f61eca52a1afb6f7f280a396f8744475e036d87c3c27a",
      "source_sha256": "0e2f1e8e234032c50051360520bef8860d0289789e6130d63c69b79ca0e3c0dd",
      "translation": "想要重来时，只需再触发一次同一个开关。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1b76e05c960b125b8fa4cc5e68844ad265a8d959b79507fe406e12d12e23511f",
      "source_sha256": "78d9453dae03e21f0395917891d26b596a40a8ba3aa9f376ce1e1a204591bfe6",
      "translation": "若要完全从头开始，就启动中央的“启动开关”。这样，一切都会回到原点。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:be231ee254f41f5077e474f34b990fc712bf336a38190e212f5b6c99d5bf3817",
      "source_sha256": "19b64d045148da786a55ed3638c6383e759bc798041c6344a3768228742a9330",
      "translation": "只要完成明智之试炼的“智慧”“聪敏”“洞察”全部3个区域，就能通过第1道关卡。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:934e3beda375093ecf25c872bf7d6052c4250c63f28d635e61c615f3bfacf5ad",
      "source_sha256": "d26d3bf435861d138e2e2a5226f545236132e96938150db067df62e1eb248023",
      "translation": "唔，也就是说，要努力产生属性KAN，来启动开关？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:716cd84b1cecdf9530ac9a4fba7d86b69c2b7f8fbbe3890b792bec27104aeecc",
      "source_sha256": "0e5f4545ae89ac5008f861e9939e5ff0b23f846c24b02864cbb67291397260e3",
      "translation": "这可难办了。我和朱特，都无法产生属性KAN。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:901ca856fbf8bdf0a820513e1cb870f1c9e75c496e0d2a30ca94837c9903e34f",
      "source_sha256": "01f2dd44655fb9a173c6715297377992af039754519af997a1a41ed0ad20e484",
      "translation": "就算失误，只要按下启动开关，就能回到起点，应该没问题。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ed60f42e38181adf97cd3175c5ce08d4625d1b362abc67a685fb9df3ec0f4d7a",
      "source_sha256": "0a775abaef92694dcba772de5be6c4fbfef45e8a456c85666f1c1690f32cc204",
      "translation": "要是还不明白，就再看看石碑吧。应该能看到我翻译的文字。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3ab02f49a0af0a683b2c04912ffc6c1a2f38033bb171b5bdbef64aee235d0fd3",
      "source_sha256": "121e887725bc66412c25191c6ee6f97e3b4b476a422370029888f3bfb386e2b1",
      "translation": "呼，真累啊。总算是通过了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:49d98a855b3f70bd82d8a38a51228d7a671f958d7169f89b884ff59b0343f855",
      "source_sha256": "536480c301dc44eb8db99431db6d0ea798f361d2582c447746ad2fe158212f57",
      "translation": "克罗塞尔，打起精神来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2829758d12f6956e362daf8154b7e564c83c6fdd07c174430b9469de50cd20fa",
      "source_sha256": "0020fd70f5ee5b51328af292af5a0840accdfd1051bcc71223a26519aad5672c",
      "translation": "嘿嘿嘿……真令人吃惊。你们竟然能来到这里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:242079f366354fdfdb91df8fe28e086c5f2e21469e1d79ad81ef68b42eea8016",
      "source_sha256": "e7b3a0b572ca5918005a20014a934c5232ccb7354a3911e76913cafa269869f0",
      "translation": "你一定是修恩扎伊特大人，创造出的最出色的作品。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:90e225782b066d2b5c74b5f3ead5f2a5a1d23886c7045ce7821c1e8efb55b37b",
      "source_sha256": "70c89dc2e98f2ddccf3d8652ddc00b7fef12c3a2e3e10bba031396b6687fa768",
      "translation": "要挡我们的路，还是从这里让开，选一个吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a65b402c5f6e4acc5412a53e5050d7645322d58d4d8b0e9b2d0bf756cbfdac14",
      "source_sha256": "0e962cae4dbe3c34b39ac60701b4eb29ff665dd2e50ea158d4e4d281a5aa228a",
      "translation": "后者从一开始，就不在我的选项里，你还让我选什么？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e6e2a1c24f3d098501557172a14aa6751238b8f245f24e84775db6ea375ae5bb",
      "source_sha256": "4aaf377174ae3795ac09ee45c2c1f41486e913d5d08f335d7e71fd7c16f8eae0",
      "translation": "我一直都很想，把你解剖一次。看看你究竟是多么出色的哨兵。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:21da325b334b263711fd876ba291eb3fbc809b20477eea8a0f79529bc701fbc4",
      "source_sha256": "22639b87602b3058106403e9fa256f0d7aee53eb3576d3c33993eff864771df8",
      "translation": "嘻嘻……你果然……是最出色的哨兵……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a15f144ffb3a50b1458f8be6cebbd4e5a1e3169f1bf08da082796898a8e840cd",
      "source_sha256": "0e061bf352d005e5daf1cf59bb832d67739290123ab0038b52dcf1cc30f5fb94",
      "translation": "不过，修恩扎伊特大人……比你更强……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fd5439d452fdf939ba302614124d6cddc8d3245f362af0241782dff222914b89",
      "source_sha256": "54447f52087a01c9835e6c350d299336516d1e6f6b2b7087385c0910a87e8852",
      "translation": "那又怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9165b3b3c90b36555c5320d7cbebb9a24a5c7d912a89c9a3a96cccb260a985af",
      "source_sha256": "67ddfc6f728c69a115cee516188cf4a7c3b06b7c243b8a8c8c53202563e81948",
      "translation": "嘻嘻嘻……要是我的身体……再完美一点……本来就能赢的……真遗憾啊……嘻嘻嘻。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5704007fc9863bdce9907dd010fe22ba4ebb4e8572ee5d4d50ff22171239bc02",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:612b49d3124336d2777ea48656426448397f8863136f6e999a399a017b9a569c",
      "source_sha256": "e74e4bcefb695556875cd9804732f2f0319bb6df43ae95aa698efc253b55450f",
      "translation": "这次又是什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9075864a83454f34f49fefd2c396df6cdf641c50e8d13c131372ee0c548f8e23",
      "source_sha256": "d9ff5fab70e76639e96e1be460f1751002012c851f359ff4f279453c2ca73833",
      "translation": "拜托你了，塞蕾丝汀。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:54e79b9cf802f6f4fbfeee1c5121c9b83aca14d651c72d32322a162cce6c5fbb",
      "source_sha256": "b3843343ea0cf90ca9a447684beb84caf5f9ccf28a453b47eac136c225f1e94c",
      "translation": "嗯，交给我吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e2cedf34718af2d0ea8c1941cf870d050021e2aafa091ca29c86dd70f6cfe6ed",
      "source_sha256": "ef1a9a698c0b6a59a6327fb6b3d3a17f8f7570a39553d03ffa3ecf0c332057aa",
      "translation": "这里是第二道关卡。想要通过此处，就挑战“祭品之试炼”吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9484584c5ca74a0824d5d44791c4e689d23c66ad686119737bad2dac496ceb5f",
      "source_sha256": "bd20e44bc5236e53b0582c9daf62226906383a7458793e7d34613a485b4f4915",
      "translation": "祭品之试炼，是在“勇气”“勇猛”“真勇”这3个区域，保护继承王族血脉之人。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bf8670f5740a1c8d1d6b938a7c76648f29c57e2f63603b0d382ad6c432e34bbf",
      "source_sha256": "03bc52e19df36e4dff23e77071744b64f1010d504fd23e61ae22a9bd4a67a3b0",
      "translation": "继承王族血脉，也就是卡尔塔血脉之人，成为祭品，站上魔法阵吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:460a5425833ef323a9700e00294c3355e6e04f2a948c75e6830e86fc870c41cc",
      "source_sha256": "ed35f31f13ada67e8145b0b7b1f7e86708526c02d888607476afec75ac6b76fb",
      "translation": "这样，各区域的“试炼之球”，便会向祭品的身体涌来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:123f3a013c262d4939cb8c160e44aff6aa1a6287acdb7b4e92778a72da4ec98b",
      "source_sha256": "3fa35035966242042a8c0268ef141a6013859d8b05ba97885ba40a79fbd398b5",
      "translation": "魔法阵会产生“庇护之光”，保护祭品。但试炼之球一旦接触庇护之光，就会爆炸，使祭品承受痛苦。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:400a720eab7ba69a9e48c99437d7c466e4e88c9efdece44405fb5a718c660fff",
      "source_sha256": "c4d851f8d2caa4560918530eaa4d2f194041b72314fc5cb0c2ee650156b2ea0b",
      "translation": "在试炼之球爆炸前，将其摧毁。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b5d8f273c76b6433ef2e0ba14c04b57a3ec5acd7dca312683d595732d898d66a",
      "source_sha256": "09232b191d9eb9446073c528ed88f71b62388c06a3e3bb4008d0cbdd05add335",
      "translation": "各区域也和第一道关卡一样，有对应四种属性的4种开关。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5043c1dc1d34f34675ff236f5e1e0c9a43cf6a171bbd6e1d8ebd024fe7ff1f16",
      "source_sha256": "a00abaa0670d56f17eb08077f48432b5351d1be5f039b776e19a34833cf3fc96",
      "translation": "触发开关，便会启动阻止球体移动的装置。请善加利用。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0220b3961f9a1b9d2aef515056398285855d0cd77c0665efec7568109e1ff606",
      "source_sha256": "dd0e07004139a6b32cdca37cacbc773c30d97a4c217fd8f7e7398e6dd7b6f8cc",
      "translation": "守护庇护之光与祭品一段时间后，就能前往下一个区域。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:260e0f455bd9d08bc07ac01dda3569cd139d0bfb418d12d27ed5eef350b4a774",
      "source_sha256": "2c105cdd6bf9f03bfeab183e6f6e779b91d02a7e9f00344f7701d9477d762dbd",
      "translation": "但是，球体接触庇护之光，引发10次爆炸后，庇护之光就会消失。即使还有剩余时间，也会以失败告终。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:03bfcf639d92443ebd2e399f13978e0549de2415c46db38c777f289768d40096",
      "source_sha256": "f65966e4b78555befa2e22dfe304e73fc0a7f672018360bc613d8bd9b5e0f24e",
      "translation": "此时，只要启动魔法阵旁的“启动开关”，就会重新生成庇护之光，可以从头再次挑战。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:35a25adc22fb74f21f739b83a3088f19783140ffbd7010d39fac495053ff8383",
      "source_sha256": "d87cc6452e1294c3e6973974bc7db38058154205d0c033f64d570457503679b1",
      "translation": "只要完成祭品之试炼的“勇气”“勇猛”“真勇”全部3个区域，就能通过第二道关卡。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bc85044e6b2a43f97984042a1b2e96534cf54dfbb80c62d7b0735ddc7d76caf7",
      "source_sha256": "65d7788ac098b3c7956aad31b33cc35a9e357de5cd44b2ea7d3ffccf992de968",
      "translation": "没问题吗，洁菲？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:260cac8f20b6252c40856c9d3ad43db68ed2c0e912d6e7b49989c410dce028f8",
      "source_sha256": "c8338a4e7ee0df1cf45214f29d0c9e4952ef6aa3a0efd7234de250b0a86f2c6a",
      "translation": "嗯，我试试。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d3298378432602925b0969dfec07d099e36a51eaa36602d8d3e919b27558213f",
      "source_sha256": "6292fd408eb6d44fb09d134be5b0457450807af40b3602fe7fa8f4a714dc160f",
      "translation": "公主殿下，我们一定会保护你，相信我们吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b087a67027b53f5588789b75a6a6e26affbeb13b754ef276aa83faa46ac9f4d5",
      "source_sha256": "723951c500b8a6efe9651e51a32d1b1d15bdb54ecc01207970050ea631aae70a",
      "translation": "比想象中还不容易呢。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b10ef23fc2a141d8ee0a3824bae66d3c976b495b673a360d406ed36e55add537",
      "source_sha256": "35e46aa54afcdbe4f9323b7870dd38fa97bb9a57024844bb2f8cfd9af6f50d27",
      "translation": "我没事，按下启动开关，再试一次吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:94d62a748ccbf882d9e2ee50842de074aa80c32c909373266a6c585c10d31cf1",
      "source_sha256": "bf85f5ce81a8b279cf931bc8f4f5d040618dc20d2745bcca96a1315a96b2b616",
      "translation": "大家辛苦了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1fc515e4ca6a318695bedee5cb5b1fc9bcf0673746969e5f8d6a78f45b86c2e1",
      "source_sha256": "f7b07a58193b80f12af8c733f37b7176b7d4152f51d30ee70c29afc848fc9819",
      "translation": "成功了。去下一个区域吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ab961e65aa1722b62de3ed6b4fc517f2b0eaabd5e48a0855816ad9032dbecc84",
      "source_sha256": "fd3cd304a9786f1af8b6f9f50984eab93f906ebca794a768da2b3aa4a2ae506e",
      "translation": "大家，拜托了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:81e6ce8577382280e669edfc62c8476ae0b90844179bba1b04d61e638f3eedd3",
      "source_sha256": "b28b51b90782784e8699749eff43ce46e1ad95524ac8f3637fdfc45534383c26",
      "translation": "嗯，别担心。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7bf41113947510b7039dfc98c91bc1240ddb372b7ab7429cc40e8c414e5d4d62",
      "source_sha256": "2fc44ca0231efd664fe66c38e7d68acc58d4e56bfd2b39b1e7acf742b6861967",
      "translation": "成功了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d35da3193a08895df10f35975ae2de330a6fe7013bfcb649ac1e10308e9d8e1c",
      "source_sha256": "be348af8d4ddb65559ea460801a1c9b23a235741fe16e553887f987b844871cb",
      "translation": "好，那就去下一个区域吧～"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f1db7d2a644efa17fc0e3776e2bbb6e50b3528e25025c383853325d4454d8c92",
      "source_sha256": "5e4452155d4c382f62689f818c8e1b64dd24ca853c6a26ea7c134d44157e0e08",
      "translation": "终于到最后了。只要完成这个，就结束了吧？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5dc31dc455a0f95ffa1ba4c61b4be6bd5c61ed2b14a3b1364f95585a65e800c7",
      "source_sha256": "806e245f31f1eaaa9d1445695d82967dcc52277a77e2013d5eb86472135aa973",
      "translation": "嗯，这是最后一个了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9a1d4baede7a327b817cbb2e2f459ac3aceedf86dd6c3bbe1d3ab2dd53699362",
      "source_sha256": "31d630fccce2233831f83afb09de003924715173c529222b8d572404de77ae79",
      "translation": "太好了，成功了！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:98015e1fbe1e50b41f3875393dbd21ae8762c426ee5084e2fa34ba3694787562",
      "source_sha256": "ad6e366fe3e1d6f31f42d5866f1c37860e32c064df552620fa755569107598ee",
      "translation": "是啊，第二道关卡也通过了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dde47f60fde95065515be03360d82d1a943de66980a3fd3d33ad752a20914410",
      "source_sha256": "85c4901f0b6cae8c32f05f71266331f92d8617349ca536b61a4bd3acd049b00e",
      "translation": "不过，还不知道前面会有什么。大家小心。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6d19b57b04d1a0ebb65c52443d61b700c0a323aa76acbfded031a89d3dbb2a48",
      "source_sha256": "8e640d7f3f8345e19ed76ce3eed5627a1da2bd14114a63a5fed352078674869d",
      "translation": "[明智之试炼]\\n填满两个与各开关颜色对应的属性KAN，就会打开道路。\\n一条道路打开时，另一边的道路就会关闭。\\n若要重来，请按下[启动开关]。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f8b883ea83845ea695e5b1b9b0fa42fa406fb21a2649930e9f50474883a8fa78",
      "source_sha256": "2d88698617120d9bdd773bc8e94b1a0ab618262295910bcb4cb6fd125b22198d",
      "translation": "[祭品之试炼]\\n*必须保护成为祭品之人一段时间。\\n*能量球与魔法阵的防护罩碰撞10次，试炼就会失败。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e30a71c287013b52c7b03886f64638b27379c5a847b5a17fafb500c54c99208f",
      "source_sha256": "d3d8ee30cd7e089b08dc78503d3bd423c2e6e6692d728bb0104a6299364c45c4",
      "translation": "*和第一场试炼一样，给开关填满属性KAN，就能阻止球体移动。\\n*必须通过3场试炼，才能前往下一个房间。\\n*若要重来，请按下[启动开关]。"
    }
  ]
}
